# External API Contract Rules

- Keep external endpoints under `/api/external/v1/` backward compatible.
- Use `POST` for all merchant API endpoints unless a new version explicitly states otherwise.
- Keep request/response DTOs aligned with API docs before merging.
- Preserve a single `ErrorDetails` structure in all 4xx/5xx responses.
- Validate required fields at API boundary; avoid hidden defaults for critical payment fields.
- For multipart endpoints, apply dedicated payload building and signing logic as specified.
- If behavior changes, include contract tests and update API docs in the same task.
